+  // (headers absent or conflicting with <sys/socket.h>) and other embedded
+  // Linux systems. /proc/net/route is a kernel-provided file present on every
+  // Linux system with the same hex-encoded ASCII columns. The default route
+  // is the row whose Destination field is 00000000 and whose Flags include
+  // RTF_GATEWAY (0x2).
